2026-07-27T12:27:27.0070643Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:27:27.0071226Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:27:27.0072378Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:27:27.0073673Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:27:27.0075073Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
